WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.988
Let’s walk through Inbox.

00:00:01.988 --> 00:00:05.500
Treat the inbox as incoming context for the Notetaker seat

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:05.638
.

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:08.312
Open the complete message, decide what it changes in

00:00:08.312 --> 00:00:11.150
your observation record, and avoid treating receipt of a

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.912
message as evidence of a team decision.

00:00:13.912 --> 00:00:16.837
On this slide, read White Cell updates addressed to

00:00:16.837 --> 00:00:18.125
the Notetaker seat;

00:00:18.125 --> 00:00:20.637
the badge marks unopened messages.

00:00:20.637 --> 00:00:24.225
In practice, bring relevant new context into your observation

00:00:24.225 --> 00:00:28.025
record without treating the inbox itself as a team decision

00:00:28.025 --> 00:00:28.188
.

00:00:28.685 --> 00:00:31.435
When you are ready, use Open Inbox to move

00:00:31.435 --> 00:00:32.910
to the live surface.

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:35.610
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:35.760
.
